# App Contract Proof

Covered by shared activity-domain app/game contracts:

- `AppGameSessionSummarySchema`
- `AppGameSessionDailyRollupSchema`
- `AppGameSessionEndReasonSchema`
- `AppGameSessionRollupDateSchema`

App-specific boundary:

- This slice does not fork app-only session schemas.
- Native app session rows continue to use the shared app/game evidence spine.
- Browser pages and browser games remain out of scope.

Final validation commands are recorded in `10-validation-commands.log`.
